Scope of this license

The MIT License above applies to the code and texts written for this project:
index.html, globe.js and the scripts in tools/.

It does NOT apply to the files in tiles/ and data/. Those are derived from
third-party sources and remain under the terms of those sources, listed in
README.md (section "Credits and data licenses"). In particular, the
place files data/places*.json contain GeoNames data, licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0), which requires attribution,
and data/population.json contains United Nations, World Bank, IMF and OECD
data under their respective terms; the IMF's terms require its permission for
